"""CMU CS-related scope review (owner decision 2026-10-22): one decision per candidate of
hierarchy/cmu/cs-related-candidates.json (DBLP-based list, 318), keyed by candidate index.

ACCEPT maps candidate index -> the people.py name of the accepted person (duplicate OpenAlex ids of one person map to the
same name). REJECT maps candidate index -> (decision, reason, [evidence specs]). Evidence specs (resolved by build.py):
  ('thesis', student)                 the person's own CMU thesis record (KiltHub / SCS reports archive), copied into the store
  ('listing', regex)                  a quote cut from a captured department listing (listings sweep store or this review's)
  ('page', url_like, regex)           a quote cut from a page in hierarchy/cmu/cs-related-captures.sqlite
  ('census', census name)             the census row's title and first quoted source (census/cmu-faculty.json)
  ('override', name)                  the reviewed exclusion in hierarchy/census-overrides.json / hierarchy/cmu/report.json
  ('advised', note)                   the candidate's advised thesis records (KiltHub Advisor(s) field), summarized
  ('searched', text)                  what was searched without finding a basis
Decisions: accepted, not_faculty, faculty_no_pi_evidence, not_at_school_in_window, same_person_as_existing_pi, unresolved.
"""
